		{
			description: [
				"魔法并非一夜之间就能掌握的东西。"
				""
				"Bewitchment 是 Drake's Paradise 中最深入、最 rewarding 的模组之一，为愿意研究其秘密的玩家提供强大的仪式、炼金术、诅咒、伙伴和古代魔法。与大多数章节不同，本章仅作为基础知识的入门。"
				""
				"&eUpon completing this quest, you'll receive the &dBook of Shadows&e—the definitive guide to every spell, ritual, ingredient, and magical system within Bewitchment. Whenever you're unsure what to do next, consult its pages. It was designed to answer nearly every question you may have."
				""
				"你的巫术之旅才刚刚开始。"
				""
				"&7\"最伟大的魔法源于知识。\""
			]
			icon: "bewitchment:book_of_shadows"
			id: "6DF27B88FA041921"
			rewards: [{
				id: "281D89386CF87823"
				item: "bewitchment:book_of_shadows"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "古老的传统方式……"
			tasks: [{
